---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
assertion_line: 607
expression: "SELECT a FROM t LEFT SEMI JOIN u ON t.a = u.a AND u.d = 'y' AND t.b = 'x' WHERE t.c > 1"
---
Join LeftSemi, (a#0 == a#3)
:- Project [a#0]
:  +- Filter (((c#2 > 1L) and (b#1 == 'x')) and isnotnull(a#0))
:     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
+- Project [a#3]
   +- Filter ((d#4 == 'y') and isnotnull(a#3))
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
